    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "1e98e17e-217f-47b0-a096-12d2794be63c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* Udine hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWelcome dinner\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EA full programme of included excursions \u0026amp; guided tours\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional tour manager\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Italy\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Italy\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "51a72e28-4f7a-470e-a4aa-9d64b40bc914",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ESix nights at the 4* Astoria Hotel in the historic city centre of Udine. Facilities include a restaurant and bar and all rooms are en suite. A welcome dinner is included in the hotel and the remaining nights are on bed and breakfast basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "a968a746-4361-4495-beba-a2f39fc6c51f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Udine\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Treviso\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseo Civico\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Trieste\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseo Revoltella\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAquileia\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBasilica di Santa Maria Assunta - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGrado\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EChurch of Sant\u2019Antonio Abate\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScuola Mosaicisti del Friuli - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECividale - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETempietto Longobardo\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGallerie del Tiepolo\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "07e5ab29-04c8-4e51-bdd1-e19cddc789f9",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPordenone - the historic pedestrianised Corso Vittorio Emanuele II is lined with covered portici, smart shops and busy cafes\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECastello di Miramare - a white castle set in lush green gardens beside the Adriatic Sea, built by the Habsburg Archduke Maximilian as his summer retreat a few years before he was assassinated in Mexico\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "4c3ea05e-b606-410d-b8f5-98f1485e4156",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Guided tour of Udine\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Italy from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer with our tour manager in our private executive coach to Udine, ruled by the Venetians for 400 years, where a guided tour includes the Duomo with paintings and frescoes by Giambattista Tiepolo \u2013 check in at the 4* Astoria Hotel in the historic city centre of Udine \u2013 dinner in the hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Guided tour of Treviso \u0026amp; Museo Civico\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Treviso takes in Chiesa di San Francesco, with works by Thomas da Modena, and the 12th century Duomo with Titian\u2019s \u2018Annunciation\u2019 and the \u2018Adoration of the Magi\u2019 fresco by Titian\u2019s arch rival, Il Pordenone \u2013 the Museo Civico houses a fine collection of paintings by Giovanni Bellini, Donatelli and other Renaissance artists.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Guided tour of Trieste \u0026amp; Museo Revoltella\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Trieste, once the fourth largest city in the Austro-Hungarian Empire, takes in views of the Duomo and Castello di San Giusto, a hilltop castle built by the city\u2019s Venetian governors from 1386 \u2013 visit the Museo Revoltella, a 19th century palazzo owned by Baron Pasquale Revoltella who helped fund the building of the Suez Canal and whose art collection now forms the basis of a modern art collection.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013Aquileia, the Basilica di Santa Maria Assunta \u0026amp; Grado\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAquileia is a World Heritage Site encircled by the ruins of palatial Roman villas, baths, temples and market buildings and it was here that Emperor Augustus received Herod the Great, King of Judea in 10 BC \u2013 a guided tour of the Basilica di Santa Maria Assunta in Aquileia explores much of the original structure including its brilliant 4th century mosaic floor \u2013 at Grado, a historic seaside town that at one time was more important than Venice, we visit the Basilica di Sant\u2019Eufemia containing 6th century frescoes in the apse.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Church of Sant\u2019Antonio Abate \u0026amp; Scuola Mosaicisti del Friuli\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Church of Sant\u2019Antonio Abate in San Daniele del Friuli houses a beautiful Renaissance cycle of frescoes by Martino da Udine, known as \u2018Pellegrino da San Daniele\u2019 \u2013 the town is famous for ham production and your tour manager will offer an optional traditional ham tasting lunch \u2013 a guided tour explores the Scuola Mosaicisti del Friuli in Spilimbergo, an internationally renowned mosaic school founded in 1922.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Cividale, Tempietto Longobardo \u0026amp; Gallerie del Tiepolo\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA guided tour of the UNESCO listed town of Cividale, founded by Julius Caesar in 50 BC, takes in the small 8th century Lombard chapel of Tempietto Longobardo \u2013 Venetian artist Giambattista Tiepolo came to Udine early in his career and left an extensive legacy in the town which are now housed in the Gallerie del Tiepolo \u2013 optional dinner at a carefully selected agriturismo restaurant.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7 \u2013 Home\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETransfer to the airport for our scheduled flight back home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
